docs {
  List all known on-chain versions of a package, given any one version's
  ID.

  **Service:** `sui.rpc.v2.MovePackageService` · **Method:** `ListPackageVersions` (unary)

  **Request fields:**
  - `package_id` (required string): the storage ID of any version of the
    package.
  - `page_size` (optional uint32): max entries to return. Default 1000, max 10000.
  - `page_token` (optional bytes): pass `next_page_token` to paginate.

  Example uses `0x2` (Sui Framework), which has multiple historical
  versions on mainnet.

  Verified against `sui-mainnet.g.alchemy.com`.
}
